                                "english": "So it was in a pair of tiny red hotpants that Jay-Z's best friend made her entrance to the VIP area of Paris-Bercy's Palais Omnisports, where she met up with her BFF Beyoncé come to support her husband, ex-Destiny's Child Kelly Rowland, and engaged director Spike Lee."
